   Software on devices that you own or control.

   You may use the Software for any purpose, personal or professional,
   including in the course of your work and on behalf of your employer. What
   you dictate, and what you use it for, is your business.

   This license is granted to ONE PERSON. It covers your own use on your own
   devices, however many of those you have. It does not cover use by anyone
   else, and it does not cover deploying the Software for other people to use.
   Each person who uses the Software does so under their own license and their
   own account; passing on the installer, as section 2 permits, is how they get
   one.

   The free tier is provided at no charge. Paid plans are provided on the terms
   stated in TERMS.md for as long as the plan is active.

2. REDISTRIBUTION
   You may redistribute the official, unmodified installer exactly as it was
   published, free of charge, provided that:
     (a) it is passed on complete and unaltered, including this LICENSE and all
         accompanying notices;
     (b) you charge nothing for it and bundle it with nothing that is sold; and
     (c) recipients remain bound by this Agreement.
   You may not repackage, re-sign, rename, or otherwise modify the installer
   before redistributing it.

   Passing the installer to a friend or colleague is fine and always was. Each
   recipient uses it under their own license, on their own account.

