6. PRIVACY
   The Software performs speech recognition locally on your device; raw audio
   is not transmitted off the device. The Software is not fully offline: it
   checks for updates, downloads a speech model once, and reads your plan when
   you are signed in. See PRIVACY.md for the full description of the Software's
   network behavior and of the data held about you.

